{
  "_comment": [
    "EchoBharat language-pack manifest.",
    "",
    "Voice packs (per language): IndicConformer STT (int8 ONNX, Apache-2.0, from",
    "  parismitaglobalsolutions/indicconformer-sherpa-onnx) and FastPitch + HiFi-GAN TTS",
    "  exported by model-export/ (MIT). Odia has no published STT export and so no pack.",
    "",
    "Translation (shared, not per language): the two IndicTrans2 distilled-200M families,",
    "  MIT-licensed int8 ONNX conversions by TigreGotico. One model per direction covers every",
    "  language; a phone needs the family that translates INTO its own language, plus",
    "  indic-en to understand one Indian language from another (pivoting through English).",
    "  The file names keep their original hi-en / en-hi spelling so existing installs and",
    "  sideloads still resolve. 'fast' files are the KV-cache decoders: optional, ~1.7x faster",
    "  on long sentences, and the app falls back to the cacheless decoder without them.",
    "",
    "A file is installable only once BOTH url and sha256 are set; until then the Model",
    "Manager reports 'Not published' and refuses to install rather than trusting an",
    "unverified download (Rules §19).",
    "",
    "Sideload during development (no publishing needed):",
    "  adb push <file> /sdcard/Android/data/com.echobharat/files/models/<lang or mt>/<fileName>"
  ],
